<h2><span data-i18n="review.common.overview">Overview</span></h2>
<p>Grammarly is the world's most popular AI-powered writing assistant, helping over 30 million people write clearer, more effective content every day. Far more than a simple spell checker, Grammarly provides real-time suggestions for grammar, spelling, punctuation, clarity, engagement, and delivery across all your writing platforms.</p>
<p>What makes Grammarly exceptional is its seamless integration across virtually every writing platform you use. From web browsers and Microsoft Office to Gmail, Slack, and social media, Grammarly works wherever you write. Its AI-powered tone detection helps ensure your message lands the right way, while advanced features like plagiarism detection and brand consistency tools make it invaluable for professionals.</p>
<p>Used by students, professionals, and businesses worldwide, Grammarly has evolved from a grammar checker into a comprehensive writing assistant. The platform's generative AI features can now help you compose, rewrite, and ideate, making it a complete solution for anyone who writes regularly. Whether you're crafting emails, writing reports, or creating content, Grammarly helps you communicate more effectively.</p>
