<h2 id="comparison">How It Compares</h2>
<h3>Grammarly vs QuillBot</h3>
<p>Grammarly offers superior grammar checking and broader platform integration, while QuillBot excels at paraphrasing and summarization. Grammarly's real-time suggestions are more comprehensive, but QuillBot provides better value for students needing paraphrasing tools. For general writing improvement, Grammarly is the better choice.</p>
<h3>Grammarly vs Wordtune</h3>
<p>Wordtune focuses more on rewriting and rephrasing suggestions, while Grammarly emphasizes correctness and clarity. Grammarly has better grammar checking and broader platform support. Wordtune offers more creative rewriting options but lacks plagiarism detection. Both tools complement each other well.</p>

